{"seq":3,"slug":"start-reserve-bid-increment","title":"起拍价、保留价与加价幅度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/start-reserve-bid-increment","wordCount":1865,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"起拍价-保留价与加价幅度\">起拍价、保留价与加价幅度</h1><p>三个参数决定了拍卖的「骨架行为」：起拍价决定第一笔报价从哪里开始，保留价决定什么价位以下宁可不卖，加价幅度决定整场拍卖会产生多少笔报价事件。它们看起来是运营配置，实际上是数据模型与并发模型的地基——加价幅度选错会让事件量翻十倍，保留价处理错会让流拍进入错误终态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个参数回答三个不同的问题，不能互相替代。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>是否公开</th>\n<th>未满足时的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起拍价</td>\n<td>从哪个价格开始接受出价</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>拍卖从该价起，无出价则流拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留价</td>\n<td>低于什么价位不卖</td>\n<td>可公开可保密</td>\n<td>最高价未达标则流拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加价幅度</td>\n<td>一次最小加价多少</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低于幅度的出价被拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>保留价的定义是「卖家愿意接受的最低价格」，卖家的 walk-away 点；出价低于保留价不会赢得标的（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reserve_price\">Wikipedia, Reserve price</a>）。起拍价则是<strong>公开</strong>的第一档价，与保留价完全不同：起拍价可以远低于保留价，用来吸引围观与出价。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[卖家配置] --&gt; B[起拍价 start_price&lt;br/&gt;公开 首档出价]&#10;  A --&gt; C[保留价 reserve_price&lt;br/&gt;可隐藏 成交下限]&#10;  A --&gt; D[加价幅度 increment&lt;br/&gt;公开 最小步长]&#10;  B --&gt; E{有出价?}&#10;  E --&gt;|无| F[流拍 no_bid]&#10;  E --&gt;|有| G{最高价 ≥ 保留价?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[流拍 reserve_not_met]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[落槌 hammer]&#10;  G --&gt; J[每笔出价校验&lt;br/&gt;≥ 当前价 + 幅度]\">graph TD\n  A[卖家配置] --&gt; B[起拍价 start_price&lt;br/&gt;公开 首档出价]\n  A --&gt; C[保留价 reserve_price&lt;br/&gt;可隐藏 成交下限]\n  A --&gt; D[加价幅度 increment&lt;br/&gt;公开 最小步长]\n  B --&gt; E{有出价?}\n  E --&gt;|无| F[流拍 no_bid]\n  E --&gt;|有| G{最高价 ≥ 保留价?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[流拍 reserve_not_met]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[落槌 hammer]\n  G --&gt; J[每笔出价校验&lt;br/&gt;≥ 当前价 + 幅度]</pre><h2 id=\"保留价的两种公开策略\">保留价的两种公开策略</h2><h3 id=\"公开保留价\">公开保留价</h3><p>保留价直接展示。好处是明确预期、减少无效出价与无效围观；坏处是把卖家的底牌摊开，竞价区间被压缩在「保留价到出价上限」之间，通常落槌价更贴近保留价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保密保留价\">保密保留价</h3><p>保留价只在后台生效，前台只显示「尚未达到卖家保留价」。UCC §2-328 明确允许这种做法：卖家可以公开也可以不公开最低可接受价，保密保留价下卖家保留不出售的权利（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/ucc/2/2-328\">Cornell LII, UCC §2-328</a>）。保密保留价的收益来自信息不对称——竞买人不知道底线在哪，只能按自己的估值出价，可能冲过保留价更高。</p>\n<p>代价是<strong>必须显式呈现「未达标」状态</strong>。否则竞买人以为自己赢了、系统却判定流拍，这是最典型的纠纷来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"最优保留价\">最优保留价</h3><p>理论上的最优保留价有简洁结论：在对称竞买人、独立私人估值的条件下，最优保留价与竞买人数量<strong>无关</strong>；估值在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上均匀分布时，最优保留价是 50（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reserve_price\">Wikipedia, Reserve price</a>，引 Myerson 1981）。当竞买人估值分布不对称时，结论会破——此时最优保留价确实取决于竞买人数量（同上，引 Gunay、Meng、Nagelberg 2013）。工程含义：不要把「最优保留价为 50」当成可以照搬的运营默认值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加价幅度的阶梯设计\">加价幅度的阶梯设计</h2><p>加价幅度的实质是一个分段常数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>inc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{inc}(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：价格越高，绝对增量越大。这样做是为了在低价区保持报价流动性，在高价区避免无意义的密集报价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阶梯的典型形状\">阶梯的典型形状</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;increment_schedule&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 0.01, &quot;max&quot;: 0.99, &quot;inc&quot;: 0.05 },&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 1.0, &quot;max&quot;: 4.99, &quot;inc&quot;: 0.25 },&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 5.0, &quot;max&quot;: 24.99, &quot;inc&quot;: 0.5 },&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 25.0, &quot;max&quot;: 99.99, &quot;inc&quot;: 1.0 },&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 100.0, &quot;max&quot;: 249.99, &quot;inc&quot;: 2.5 },&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 250.0, &quot;max&quot;: 499.99, &quot;inc&quot;: 5.0 },&#10;    { &quot;min&quot;: 500.0, &quot;max&quot;: null, &quot;inc&quot;: 10.0 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"increment_schedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">249.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">499.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这类分段阶梯在主流平台上是公开规则；上表是一个代表性骨架，具体数值应按平台自身规则配置而不应照抄。核心工程要求是：<strong>阶梯必须是一个数据，不是一个散布在代码里的 if-else 链</strong>，因为它需要在出价校验、代理引擎、前台展示三处保持一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幅度与事件量的关系\">幅度与事件量的关系</h3><p>拍卖产生的报价笔数量级约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>估值跨度</mtext><mtext>平均幅度</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{估值跨度}}{\\text{平均幅度}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">平均幅度</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">估值跨度</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把 500 美元以上区间的幅度从 10 降到 1，同一场拍卖的事件数会上升一个数量级，写入放大与广播压力同步上升。反过来说，如果要压低代理出价的写放大，调大高价区幅度是最直接的手段，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"首次出价的特殊规则\">首次出价的特殊规则</h3><p>多数平台允许<strong>首笔出价等于起拍价</strong>，而不是「起拍价 + 幅度」。这是一条必须写进校验规则的例外，否则没人能开出第一枪。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE bid (&#10;  bid_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  auction_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  bidder_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  amount        NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  max_amount    NUMERIC(14,2),&#10;  kind          TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT bid_amount_positive CHECK (amount &gt; 0),&#10;  CONSTRAINT bid_kind_valid CHECK (kind IN (&#39;manual&#39;,&#39;proxy&#39;,&#39;auto&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX bid_one_winner_per_auction&#10;  ON bid (auction_id) WHERE kind = &#39;hammer&#39;;&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX bid_by_auction_amount&#10;  ON bid (auction_id, amount DESC, created_at ASC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bid_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auction_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bidder_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid_amount_positive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid_kind_valid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'manual'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'proxy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bid_one_winner_per_auction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid (auction_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hammer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bid_by_auction_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid (auction_id, amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>bid_by_auction_amount</code> 这个复合索引同时服务两个高频查询：取当前最高价，以及取「次高报价且最早提交者」以确定代理出价的加价起点。索引顺序 <code>amount DESC, created_at ASC</code> 是刻意的——同价时先到者优先，这个并列打破规则见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/bid-withdraw-rule\">出价撤回与有效规则</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数校验与不可变性\">参数校验与不可变性</h2><h3 id=\"上架时校验\">上架时校验</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;start_price&quot;, &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;&gt; 0&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;reserve_price&quot;, &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;&gt;= start_price || null&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;increment&quot;, &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;covers all price bands, no gap&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;buyout_price&quot;, &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;&gt; reserve_price || null&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;immutable_after&quot;: &quot;first_bid&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"start_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"> 0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserve_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">= start_price || null\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"increment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"covers all price bands, no gap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyout_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"> reserve_price || null\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"immutable_after\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"first_bid\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两条容易漏掉的规则：<strong>加价阶梯必须无缝隙无重叠</strong>（存在价格落在所有分段之外时，出价校验会抛异常）；<strong>买断价必须高于保留价</strong>，否则买断会成为绕过底线的成交通道，见 <a href=\"buy-now-hybrid-auction\">一口价与拍卖混合</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"已有出价后的不可变性\">已有出价后的不可变性</h3><p>首笔出价之后修改保留价是最危险的操作：它会让已经成立的竞价历史失去意义。正确做法是允许修改但要求「保留价只能下调且不得低于当前最高价」，或者干脆不允许修改，只允许撤拍重上。撤拍走的路径与流拍不同，见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow\">流拍处理与重新上拍</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>首笔出价前</th>\n<th>首笔出价后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起拍价</td>\n<td>可改</td>\n<td>锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留价</td>\n<td>可改</td>\n<td>仅可下调至当前价以上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加价幅度</td>\n<td>可改</td>\n<td>可改（仅影响后续出价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买断价</td>\n<td>可改</td>\n<td>视买断权形态而定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加价幅度对外的接口契约\">加价幅度对外的接口契约</h2><h3 id=\"最低可接受出价的推导\">最低可接受出价的推导</h3><p>前台必须能回答一个问题：「我现在最少要出多少？」这个值不是一个常量，而是由当前价与阶梯共同决定的一次推导，且必须与后端校验使用<strong>同一个函数</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;next_min_bid&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;no_bids ? start_price : current_price + increment_for(current_price)&quot;,&#10;    &quot;rounding&quot;: &quot;round_up_to_currency_minor_unit&quot;,&#10;    &quot;expose&quot;: [&quot;next_min_bid&quot;, &quot;increment_for_current&quot;],&#10;    &quot;never_expose&quot;: [&quot;reserve_price_when_hidden&quot;, &quot;highest_proxy_max&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"next_min_bid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_bids ? start_price : current_price + increment_for(current_price)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rounding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"round_up_to_currency_minor_unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"expose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"next_min_bid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"increment_for_current\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"never_expose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserve_price_when_hidden\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"highest_proxy_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>never_expose</code> 里两条是硬约束：保密保留价不能被推算出来（否则保密毫无意义），代理上限更不允许通过任何推导接口泄露，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"前后端不一致的后果\">前后端不一致的后果</h3><p>若前台自己算最低出价、后端另算一套，用户会遇到「填了界面提示的金额却被拒绝」这种最伤信任的交互。因此最低出价必须由后端下发，前台只做展示；<code>increment_for</code> 函数在两侧都只作为纯计算复用，绝不各自维护一份阶梯常量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>契约项</th>\n<th>权威方</th>\n<th>前台职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最低可接受出价</td>\n<td>后端</td>\n<td>展示、预校验提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加价阶梯</td>\n<td>后端配置</td>\n<td>仅在需要展示规则时渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留价是否达成</td>\n<td>后端</td>\n<td>展示「已达成/未达成」，不展示数值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝原因与门槛</td>\n<td>后端</td>\n<td>原样展示，不自行改写文案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>起拍价公开、保留价可保密，二者角色不同；保密保留价必须显式呈现「未达标」状态。</li>\n<li>最优保留价在对称私人估值下与竞买人数无关，但估值分布不对称时结论会破，不能照搬。</li>\n<li>UCC §2-328 允许保密保留价，并赋予卖家未达标时不出售的权利。</li>\n<li>加价幅度是一个分段常数函数，必须以数据形式配置，且阶梯无缝隙无重叠。</li>\n<li>首笔出价允许等于起拍价，这是一条必须写进校验的例外。</li>\n<li>索引设计要同时服务「取最高价」与「同价先到者优先」两个查询。</li>\n<li>已有出价后参数不可随意变更，保留价尤其只能下调且不得低于当前最高价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"起拍价、保留价与加价幅度","id":"起拍价-保留价与加价幅度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"保留价的两种公开策略","id":"保留价的两种公开策略"},{"level":3,"text":"公开保留价","id":"公开保留价"},{"level":3,"text":"保密保留价","id":"保密保留价"},{"level":3,"text":"最优保留价","id":"最优保留价"},{"level":2,"text":"加价幅度的阶梯设计","id":"加价幅度的阶梯设计"},{"level":3,"text":"阶梯的典型形状","id":"阶梯的典型形状"},{"level":3,"text":"幅度与事件量的关系","id":"幅度与事件量的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"首次出价的特殊规则","id":"首次出价的特殊规则"},{"level":2,"text":"参数校验与不可变性","id":"参数校验与不可变性"},{"level":3,"text":"上架时校验","id":"上架时校验"},{"level":3,"text":"已有出价后的不可变性","id":"已有出价后的不可变性"},{"level":2,"text":"加价幅度对外的接口契约","id":"加价幅度对外的接口契约"},{"level":3,"text":"最低可接受出价的推导","id":"最低可接受出价的推导"},{"level":3,"text":"前后端不一致的后果","id":"前后端不一致的后果"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"一口价与拍卖混合：买断期权与并发串行化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/buy-now-hybrid-auction"},"next":{"title":"代理出价（proxy bid）机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent"}}